scene U: The bigger the sum, the more {N} wonders what they really expect for it.
scene B: The money is good this time, and {Ns} time is {Ns} own to sell; the word, perhaps, is not.
scene R: The kind words land, and that is what makes it hard; someone {N} loves could use this money.
scene G: The people {N} gave {Ns} word to will still be the neighbours, whatever {N} decides tonight.
