scene W: A post is a trust, and one that starts on a broken promise starts crooked.
scene U: {N} can see exactly what the post would let {N} build, and exactly what the condition would rot from inside.
scene B: This is the step up {N} has worked for, and nobody else will be handing one out soon.
scene R: The thought of being stuck where {N} is for another ten years makes {Ns} chest tight.
scene G: The people who heard {Ns} promise live on the same streets, and will be there long after any post is gone.
