# Chroma library, modern Earth: SACRED LINES, AMENDS (S5 sacred lines, v22.3, DRAFT cast_want: amends).
# The character once crossed a line they hold sacred (took the offer, broke the promise, sold the land, told the lie).
# One pair per line kind: moment a is a chance to make amends, moment b a quiet hour of looking back. No {offer} slot;
# each scene names the crossing in words that fit any offer of its line kind. Every option carries heal: amends |
# reflect | not_yet (table_amends.txt). Chances: per way, its one-letter option plus its cross (first letter) = 140.
