#   pair 2  truth     2a UR (s3) / 2b WBG (s4)
#   pair 3  own_say   3a BG (s1) / 3b WUR (s2)
#   pair 4  loved     4a WR (s3) / 4b UBG (s4)
#   pair 5  home      5a UG (s1) / 5b WBR (s2)
